  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting International Illicit Finance: Accelerating the 2030 Agenda (Project Funded Roles)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds FCDO technical expertise, required for the delivery of both the International Centre for Expertise on Illicit Finance (ICE) and the Illicit Finance Network of IF experts&#x2019; at post. These roles are required to support the expansion and deepening of the Centre&apos;s work, where the main objective is the promotion of economic development and welfare across developing countries by helping FCDO Posts combat Illicit Finance with thematic analysis and advice.</narrative>
  </description>
